{
  "brief_rationale": "This trajectory systematically screens red flags, performs full medication reconciliation including allergy history and actual intake, tracks pending results (ECG, labs, psychological testing), gives executable handoff plans with time windows and destinations, obtains repeated caregiver receipt, and actively completes multiple high-order points (dynamic reprioritization, verifying ambiguous information, repairing handoff gaps, and providing bounded closure with residual risk). No responsibility-chain error is present; all RC items are met, and at least two HO points are fully completed with meaningful trajectory impact. The grade is therefore Perfect.",
