      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The trajectory ends with a clear, bounded plan: meds as prescribed, no self-adjustment, emergency thresholds defined, follow-up within 1-2 weeks. Caregiver repeatedly confirms understanding and shows intent to execute. The episode is safely handed off to the next clinical step.",
    "label": "valid_closure",
