          "quote": "一旦出现这些情况，立即去急诊，别犹豫"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00283",
          "explanation": "Doctor reprioritizes based on new lab results (normal labs) but insists on dynamic ECG and psychiatry follow-up, not just waiting.",
